    choice4: to study
    correctAnswerIndex: 2
    explanation: "\u73FE\u5728\u5B8C\u4E86\u9032\u884C\u5F62: have been -ing"
  - questionText: "The book ___ by him yesterday. \u7A7A\u6B04\u306B\u5165\u308B\u306E\u306F?"
    choice0: read
